[[File:Elements example 1.jpg|thumb|The 4 elements.]]Elements are unlocked through {{Keyword|node|Refine Tree Node 55}}, which adds a new subtab to the Unity tab.


There are 4 elements which are  <span style="color: #cf5649 ;">'''Fire'''</span>,  <span style="color: #5aa444 ;">'''Earth'''</span>,  <span style="color: #7bdaf9 ;">'''Wind'''</span> and <span style="color: #4b6fcb ;">'''Water'''</span>. 

Each of the elements are boosted by their own zodiac element. Fire zodiacs (Aries, Leo, Sagittarius) boost <span style="color: #cf5649 ;">'''Fire'''</span> generation for example. 

You can only generate one element at a time.

The Elements tab also has Local game speed just like the Minerals tab. The base local game speed is ^0.05 to minerals local game speed, but it can be increased via [[Tarot]] cards.

=== Element Factors ===
The factors are what multiply your element generation rates, and they are based off of many things. You start with one factor for each element, but eventually it can be increased to three factors.

